1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
I'm somebody who is now going through a transformative process.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,820
I'm starting to feel more like myself than I ever have in my life.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:11,500
And I think it's largely in part because I am creating boundaries and space

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:17,440
for me to live how I want to live and not have to react to things

5
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:20,740
and do things in the protective way that I've been taught to live.

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,600
And I taught myself to live like that

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,920
because I didn't want to push people away by being too much.

8
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:29,960
I didn't want people to feel like I wasn't worth their friendship.

9
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,340
By being too much.

10
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,140
I didn't want people to judge me by being too much.

11
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,500
And so I made adjustments.

12
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,400
And those adjustments were to my detriment

13
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,620
because I wasn't getting fed the way that I really needed to be.

14
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:44,140
It feels like these are sacrifices that we make

15
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:47,100
just to be a part of civilization or society.

16
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,420
But it starts to hurt you as you get older

17
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:52,560
because it feels like you are not getting those nutrients that you needed.

